  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模组。用心制作。大量活跃的 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">首次加入消息（First Join Message）是一款简约且可配置的模组，它会在玩家首次进入世界时发送一条消息。这可用于创造更具沉浸感的初次体验，或用于显示更信息化的消息，例如服务器规则或小游戏规则。此外，还有选项可在新玩家加入时向全服务器广播一条消息。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含在《原版体验》整合包中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum 的定制包中\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"运行环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>firstJoinMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 \"你在一个陌生的地方醒来。\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家首次进入世界时收到的消息。若要禁用，请留空。%s 可用于代替玩家名称。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>firstJoinMessageTextFormattingColourIndex</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 2，最小值 0，最大值 15</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;消息的颜色。所选值可以是以下任一值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>serverBroadcastMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 \"\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家首次进入世界时广播给全服务器的消息。若要禁用，请留空。%s 可用于代替玩家名称。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>serverBroadcastMessageTextFormattingColourIndex</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 3，最小值 0，最大值 15</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;消息的颜色。所选值可以是以下任一值。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配置文件中可用的 TextFormatting.Colour 值：</strong></span><br><em>0: 黑色 (black),</em><br><em>1: 深蓝 (dark_blue),</em><br><em>2: 深绿 (dark_green),</em><br><em>3: 深青色 (dark_aqua),</em><br><em>4: 深红 (dark_red),</em><br><em>5: 深紫 (dark_purple),</em><br><em>6: 金色 (gold), </em><br><em>7: 灰色 (gray), </em><br><em>8: 深灰 (dark_gray), </em><br><em>9: 蓝色 (blue), </em><br><em>10: 绿色 (green), </em><br><em>11: 青色 (aqua), </em><br><em>12: 红色 (red), </em><br><em>13: 浅紫 (light_purple), </em><br><em>14: 黄色 (yellow), </em><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>15: 白色 (white).</em></span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><strong>游戏内默认消息：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/first-join-message/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"631\"></strong></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模组，前提是下载链接仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论功能已关闭，因为我无法在众多模组页面中逐一跟踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事项，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
